=== A. FINRA 11892 numerical-guideline buckets (not a blended table) ===
FINRA 11892: Greater than $0.00 up to and including $25.00 -> 10% / 20%;
  Greater than $25.00 up to and including $50.00 -> 5% / 10%; Greater than $50.00 -> 3% / 6%
NYSE Rule 7.10 Exhibit 5 labels the first two rows: Between $0.00 and $25.00 / Between $25.01 and $50.00
  (same percentages). $25.00 is in the first bucket under both wordings; $25.01 is in the second under both.
  FINRA bucket for $25.00: Greater than $0.00 up to and including $25.00 -> 10% / 20%
  FINRA bucket for $25.01: Greater than $25.00 up to and including $50.00 -> 5% / 10%
  FINRA bucket for $50.00: Greater than $25.00 up to and including $50.00 -> 5% / 10%
  FINRA bucket for $50.01: Greater than $50.00 -> 3% / 6%
=== B. Regular hours: an ordinary LULD-covered print is generally not reviewable ===
  LULD-covered, 15% from last sale, no listed exception: reviewable=False
  not subject to the LULD Plan: reviewable=True
  LULD-covered, bands unavailable (listed exception): reviewable=True
the old percentage table is not the regular-hours test for ordinary LULD stocks
